<div class="inspection-question-card">
    <div class="inspection-question-title">
        9. 衛生管理人員
    </div>
    <div class="inspection-question-body">
        <div class="rule-text">
            現場是否查獲逾有效日期食品?(倘查獲逾有效日期食品，請記錄該等違規產品名稱、包裝型態、有效日期、數量及逾有效日期後是否有作成產品等事項)
        </div>

        <div class="pmds-radio-group inspection-group">
            <div class="inspection-row">
                <label class="radio-inline-item" for="chk3_1">
                    <input id="chk3_1" type="checkbox" value="Y">
                    <span>符合</span>
                </label>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pmds-radio-group inspection-group">
            <div class="inspection-row">
                <label class="radio-inline-item" for="chk3_1">
                    <input id="chk3_1" type="checkbox" value="Y">
                    <span>不符合</span>
                </label>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pmds-radio-group inspection-group">
            <div class="inspection-row">
                <span>不適用，原因</span><input id="txtReason2" type="text" class="form-control" style="width:270px;" />
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pmds-radio-group inspection-group">
            <label for="chk1_4" class="check-item">
                <input id="chk1_4" type="checkbox" value="Y" />
                <span>資料待補，說明</span><input id="txtExplan1" type="text" class="form-control note-input" />
                <span>備註：</span><input id="txtNote1" type="text" class="form-control note-input" /><span>(可讓現場稽查人員依需求填寫)</span>
            </label>

            <label class="check-item">
                <span>●查核提醒事項:</span><input id="txtNote1" type="text" class="form-control note-input" /><span>(表單設計者依需求填寫填寫，倘無則不顯示)</span>
            </label>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="inspection-action-row">
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-form" id="btnSaveHealthManager">儲存</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-form" id="btnCancelHealthManager" onclick="window.history.go(-1);">取消</button>
    </div>
</div>
